PART 2: WHAT IS BOOTSTRAP?
================================================================================

BOOTSTRAP OVERVIEW
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bootstrap is:

• CSS Framework
  - Provides reusable styles

• Component Library
  - Buttons, cards, alerts, forms, navigation, etc.

• Grid System
  - Responsive 12-column layout

• Utility System
  - Spacing, colors, display, flexbox, sizing, etc.

• JavaScript Plugins
  - Interactive behavior for components such as modals, dropdowns,
    collapses, and dismissible alerts

• Customizable
  - Themes and styles can be modified

• Mobile-First
  - Responsive system starts from smaller screens

• Open Source
  - Community-maintained project

• Documented
  - Provides extensive component and utility documentation


